#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:1
msgid "Q-VAE for Energy-Supervised Anomaly Detection"
msgstr "Q-VAE 用于能量监督异常检测"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:3
msgid ""
"This case study extends the [Q-VAE MNIST tutorial](qvae_mnist.md) to tabular"
" anomaly detection. It introduces CleanEnergyQVAE: a Q-VAE with a free-"
"energy scoring head, where normal samples get lower free energy and "
"anomalies get higher free energy. Built on the Q-ELBO framework, this study "
"adds threshold search and PR/ROC evaluation."
msgstr ""
"本案例研究将 [Q-VAE MNIST 教程](qvae_mnist.md) 扩展到表格异常检测。它介绍了 "
"CleanEnergyQVAE：一种带自由能评分头的 Q-VAE，正常样本获得更低自由能，异常样本获得更高自由能。基于 Q-ELBO "
"框架，本研究增加了阈值搜索和 PR/ROC 评估。"

