#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:43
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:45
msgid ""
"CleanEnergyQVAE extends the standard Q-VAE with an RBM free-energy scoring "
"head:"
msgstr "CleanEnergyQVAE 在标准 Q-VAE 之上增加了 RBM 自由能评分头："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:53
msgid "The key innovations:"
msgstr "关键创新点："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:55
msgid ""
"**Free-energy scoring head**: an RBM on top of the latent space computes "
"free energy as the anomaly score."
msgstr "**自由能评分头**：隐空间之上的 RBM 计算自由能作为异常分数。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:56
msgid ""
"**Energy-supervised loss**: normal samples are pulled toward the QBM prior, "
"anomalies are pushed away."
msgstr "**能量监督损失**：正常样本被拉向 QBM 先验，异常样本被推离。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:57
msgid ""
"**Threshold search**: best-F1 over a candidate grid determines the decision "
"boundary."
msgstr "**阈值搜索**：在候选网格上搜索最佳 F1，确定决策边界。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:58
msgid ""
"**Evaluation**: PR-AUC, ROC-AUC, precision, recall, F1 measure anomaly "
"detection quality."
msgstr "**评估**：PR-AUC、ROC-AUC、精确率、召回率、F1 衡量异常检测质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:60
msgid ""
"The Q-ELBO still provides the reconstruction loss and KL divergence; the "
"free-energy head adds an anomaly-specific scoring objective."
msgstr "Q-ELBO 仍提供重建损失与 KL 散度；自由能头额外增加了一个针对异常的打分目标。"

