msgstr "或在一个命令中同时运行两者："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:84
msgid "Key Code"
msgstr "关键代码"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:86
msgid "1. CleanEnergyQVAE Model"
msgstr "1\\. CleanEnergyQVAE 模型"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:88
msgid ""
"The `CleanEnergyQVAE` model combines a standard Q-VAE with an RBM free-"
"energy scoring head:"
msgstr "`CleanEnergyQVAE` 模型将标准 Q-VAE 与 RBM 自由能评分头相结合："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:95
msgid "Key model details:"
msgstr "关键模型细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:96
msgid ""
"Encoder/Decoder: `CleanEncoder` / `CleanDecoder` — standard Q-VAE "
"architecture"
msgstr "编码器/解码器：`CleanEncoder` / `CleanDecoder` — 标准 Q-VAE 架构"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:97
msgid "Free-energy head: RBM on latent space for anomaly scoring"
msgstr "自由能头：隐空间上的 RBM，用于异常打分"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:98
msgid "Anomaly score: free energy (normal = low, anomaly = high)"
msgstr "异常分数：自由能（正常 = 低，异常 = 高）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:99
msgid "Loss types: margin, InfoNCE, or both (configurable)"
msgstr "损失类型：margin、InfoNCE 或两者兼有（可配置）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:103
msgid "2. Energy-Supervised Loss"
msgstr "2\\. 能量监督损失"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:105
msgid ""
"The `losses.py` implements energy-supervised loss to separate normal from "
"anomalous samples:"
msgstr "`losses.py` 实现了能量监督损失，以区分正常样本与异常样本："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:112
msgid "Key loss details:"
msgstr "关键损失细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:113
msgid "Normal samples: pulled toward QBM prior (low free energy)"
msgstr "正常样本：拉向 QBM 先验（低自由能）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:114
msgid "Anomalies: pushed away from QBM prior (high free energy)"
msgstr "异常样本：推离 QBM 先验（高自由能）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:115
msgid "`lambda_anom`: weight for anomaly energy loss (default 1.0)"
msgstr "`lambda_anom`：异常能量损失的权重（默认 1.0）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:119
msgid "3. Threshold Search and Evaluation"
msgstr "3\\. 阈值搜索与评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:121
msgid ""
"The `optimize_threshold_rbm` function implements best-F1 threshold search "
"over a candidate grid:"
msgstr "`optimize_threshold_rbm` 函数在候选网格上实现最佳 F1 阈值搜索："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:128
msgid "Training and Evaluation"
msgstr "训练 和 评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:130
msgid ""
"**Score distribution**: `plot_score_distribution` shows free energy by label"
" (normal vs anomaly)."
msgstr "**分数分布**：`plot_score_distribution` 按标签（正常 vs 异常）展示自由能。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:131
msgid ""
"**PR/ROC curves**: `plot_pr_roc_curve` generates precision-recall and "
"receiver operating characteristic curves."
msgstr "**PR/ROC 曲线**：`plot_pr_roc_curve` 生成精确率-召回率曲线与受试者工作特征（ROC）曲线。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:132
msgid ""
"**Latent t-SNE**: `plot_latent_tsne` reduces latent space to 2-D, colored by"
" label."
msgstr "**隐空间 t-SNE**：`plot_latent_tsne` 将隐空间降维到二维，按标签着色。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:133
msgid ""
"**Timeseries**: `plot_timeseries_anomaly` shows energy vs time for temporal "
"anomaly detection."
msgstr "**时间序列**：`plot_timeseries_anomaly` 展示能量随时间的变化，用于时序异常检测。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:134
msgid "**Metrics**: PR-AUC, ROC-AUC, precision, recall, F1."
msgstr "**指标**：PR-AUC、ROC-AUC、精确率、召回率、F1。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:136
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "总结"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:138
msgid ""
"CleanEnergyQVAE extends Q-VAE with a free-energy scoring head for anomaly "
"detection."
msgstr "CleanEnergyQVAE 通过自由能评分头扩展 Q-VAE，用于异常检测。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:139
msgid ""
"Energy-supervised loss separates normal from anomalous samples in latent "
"space."
msgstr "能量监督损失在隐空间中将正常样本与异常样本分开。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:140
msgid "Threshold search with best-F1 determines the decision boundary."
msgstr "以最佳 F1 进行阈值搜索可确定决策边界。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:141
msgid ""
"The Q-ELBO framework remains the same; only the scoring head and loss "
"objective are added."
msgstr "Q-ELBO 框架保持不变；仅新增了评分头与损失目标。"

